    {
      "id": "a381dda1-49ea-4b2a-b404-4d3adb940324",
      "content": "§A Do you still feel like passing your archiving work off to someone else?",
      "pageType": "story",
      "rewards": [{ "name": "Library", "url": "https://treasurehuntsites.github.io/titkokkora/Img/konyvtar.jpg", "icon": "📦" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "b6308a3f-555b-45c5-953f-d2f71d1beabd",
      "content": "§B Well, you know my opinion on all those old papers.",
      "pageType": "story",
      "rewards": [{ "icon": "📦", "url": "https://treasurehuntsites.github.io/titkokkora/Img/konyvtar.jpg", "name": "Library" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "a74e8ac0-baee-4e34-afe5-ff7d6585d493",
      "content": "§A So, what would you say to leaving the archive alone for a while?",
