      "rewards": [{ "icon": "📦", "url": "https://treasurehuntsites.github.io/titkokkora/Img/konyvtar.jpg", "name": "Library" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "1b364a2c-6adb-433d-a063-cc266cf0e89f",
      "content": "§B When do we leave?",
      "pageType": "story",
      "rewards": [{ "name": "Library", "icon": "📦", "url": "https://treasurehuntsites.github.io/titkokkora/Img/konyvtar.jpg" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "36efb458-7716-4fb9-b1b6-17acb150bd7c",
      "content": "§A Unfortunately, I'm not as young as I used to be.",
      "pageType": "story",
      "rewards": [{ "icon": "📦", "name": "Library", "url": "https://treasurehuntsites.github.io/titkokkora/Img/konyvtar.jpg" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "4c65a2da-4892-49ab-a423-cca2915c5d9e",
      "content": "§A You have to go alone, but I can still help you from here if needed.",
      "pageType": "story",
      "rewards": [{ "name": "Library", "url": "https://treasurehuntsites.github.io/titkokkora/Img/konyvtar.jpg", "icon": "📦" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "e092026f-69bc-41d9-9896-f3240915facb",
      "content": "§A Are you free this afternoon?",
      "pageType": "story",
      "rewards": [{ "name": "Library", "icon": "📦", "url": "https://treasurehuntsites.github.io/titkokkora/Img/konyvtar.jpg" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "332a3c1b-9bc7-4d3d-bccc-9995084d0550",
      "content": "§B Yes.",
      "pageType": "story",
      "rewards": [{ "url": "https://treasurehuntsites.github.io/titkokkora/Img/konyvtar.jpg", "icon": "📦", "name": "Library" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "9aec02ec-6920-4e70-9105-b94b28db459e",
      "content": "§A Alright.",
      "pageType": "story",
      "rewards": [{ "name": "Library", "icon": "📦", "url": "https://treasurehuntsites.github.io/titkokkora/Img/konyvtar.jpg" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "8bd29c4c-add6-43a0-922e-2e4ad4a12c1b",
      "content": "§A Come as soon as you can.",
      "pageType": "story",
      "rewards": [{ "icon": "📦", "name": "Library", "url": "https://treasurehuntsites.github.io/titkokkora/Img/konyvtar.jpg" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "a75cc347-f246-4b12-a20e-48c005f84654",
      "content": "§A I'm counting on you.",
      "pageType": "story",
      "rewards": [{ "name": "Library", "icon": "📦", "url": "https://treasurehuntsites.github.io/titkokkora/Img/konyvtar.jpg" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "21a5263e-31c0-41b3-8660-ffacbfd03974",
      "content": "§B It's a deal.",
      "pageType": "story",
      "rewards": [{ "url": "https://treasurehuntsites.github.io/titkokkora/Img/konyvtar.jpg", "name": "Library", "icon": "📦" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "a067df6d-3568-48f2-ac07-79055c927fd3",
      "content": "My uncle's news was somewhat mysterious, but that only increased my curiosity.",
      "pageType": "story",
      "rewards": [{ "icon": "📦", "url": "https://treasurehuntsites.github.io/titkokkora/Img/konyvtar.jpg", "name": "Library" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "0818daa2-d395-4da5-a197-7c6d2cecee92",
      "content": "A new bunker in Budapest – that's not a discovery that happens every day.",
      "pageType": "story",
      "rewards": [{ "name": "Library", "icon": "📦", "url": "https://treasurehuntsites.github.io/titkokkora/Img/konyvtar.jpg" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "e881fbb5-c5d2-4b30-abf6-ffa7a81ca0b3",
      "content": "But why this rush?",
      "pageType": "story",
      "rewards": [{ "name": "Library", "icon": "📦", "url": "https://treasurehuntsites.github.io/titkokkora/Img/konyvtar.jpg" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "c83a534e-888b-4474-934e-3191097fe293",
      "content": "It's almost 5 o'clock.",
      "pageType": "story",
      "rewards": [{ "url": "https://treasurehuntsites.github.io/titkokkora/Img/konyvtar.jpg", "name": "Library", "icon": "📦" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "6cf36719-f7b1-4653-8e33-ed786d956612",
      "content": "Time to find out more.",
      "pageType": "story",
      "rewards": [{ "name": "Library", "icon": "📦", "url": "https://treasurehuntsites.github.io/titkokkora/Img/konyvtar.jpg" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "79ee3e81-27db-49f0-9f57-ed696039624f",
      "content": "§A Thank you for not being late.",
      "pageType": "story",
      "pageBg": "https://treasurehuntsites.github.io/titkokkora/Img/nappali.jpg",
      "rewards": [{ "url": "https://treasurehuntsites.github.io/titkokkora/Img/nappali.jpg", "name": "Living Room", "icon": "📦" }],
      "hiddenItems": ["Library"]
    },
    {
      "id": "a4e7e91e-3efe-4681-b9e8-472b1acfa89e",
      "content": "§B I'm listening.",
      "pageType": "story",
      "pageBg": "https://treasurehuntsites.github.io/titkokkora/Img/nappali.jpg",
      "hiddenItems": ["Library"]
    },
    {
      "id": "92ebfc9c-cc1e-4980-97a1-6762f0ec3cf6",
      "content": "§A Only a few people know what I am about to tell you.",
      "pageType": "story",
      "pageBg": "https://treasurehuntsites.github.io/titkokkora/Img/nappali.jpg",
      "hiddenItems": ["Library"]
    },
    {
      "id": "c007d192-cf4c-4983-85f9-9dc67d4d2a86",
      "content": "§A Have you ever heard of the German Nibiru project?",
      "pageType": "story",
      "pageBg": "https://treasurehuntsites.github.io/titkokkora/Img/nappali.jpg",
      "hiddenItems": ["Library"]
    },
    {
      "id": "e3ad02cd-fde4-4eea-bf27-8aa80f431965",
      "content": "§B Nibiru? The 12th planet?",
      "pageType": "story",
      "pageBg": "https://treasurehuntsites.github.io/titkokkora/Img/nappali.jpg",
      "hiddenItems": ["Library"]
    },
    {
      "id": "2816d043-35bc-4edb-88dc-400aa031a792",
      "content": "§B What does this have to do with the Germans?",
      "pageType": "story",
      "pageBg": "https://treasurehuntsites.github.io/titkokkora/Img/nappali.jpg",
      "hiddenItems": ["Library"]
    },
    {
      "id": "333d4c5c-e7ee-44ee-809f-7ac00ee4738c",
      "content": "§A Yes, the 12th planet.",
      "pageType": "story",
      "pageBg": "https://treasurehuntsites.github.io/titkokkora/Img/nappali.jpg",
      "hiddenItems": ["Library"]
    },
    {
      "id": "72f84e6d-ad19-479c-a825-17f062a5b13c",
      "content": "§A The Germans delved into all sorts of technologies that could have helped them in their war situation.",
      "pageType": "story",
      "pageBg": "https://treasurehuntsites.github.io/titkokkora/Img/nappali.jpg",
      "hiddenItems": ["Library"]
    },
    {
      "id": "ae1540f3-00c5-4ac3-a4f4-934ec94a035e",
      "content": "§A Imagine what the technology of another highly advanced race would have meant to them.",
      "pageType": "story",
      "pageBg": "https://treasurehuntsites.github.io/titkokkora/Img/nappali.jpg",
      "hiddenItems": ["Library"]
    },
    {
      "id": "77dca7a3-9d38-462f-abf3-6bcb5400ccb1",
      "content": "§B But the 12th planet is just a myth.",
      "pageType": "story",
      "pageBg": "https://treasurehuntsites.github.io/titkokkora/Img/nappali.jpg",
      "hiddenItems": ["Library"]
    },
    {
      "id": "3965b0d5-f66d-4df5-8a3e-fde60c8f0457",
      "content": "§A What do you think?",
      "pageType": "story",
      "pageBg": "https://treasurehuntsites.github.io/titkokkora/Img/nappali.jpg",
      "hiddenItems": ["Library"]
    },
    {
      "id": "756d0f9f-225e-4a62-b934-bc38182704e7",
      "content": "§A I used to think that too, but now it's not important.",
      "pageType": "story",
      "pageBg": "https://treasurehuntsites.github.io/titkokkora/Img/nappali.jpg",
      "hiddenItems": ["Library"]
    },
    {
      "id": "c8f2c468-deb5-42e1-af12-62dba2b00303",
      "content": "§A The thing is, this bunker hides something more than just simple archives.",
